{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-frobenius-pairing-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:frobenius-pairing-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of the Frobenius pairing","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-frobenius-pairing"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-frobenius-pairing-exists"],"tags":["existence","frobenius-pairing","quantum-universe"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.FrobeniusHopfData.frobeniusForm_exists","text":"frobenius-pairing-exists.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:frobenius-pairing-exists\"></a><p>The Frobenius form makes the multiplication a non-degenerate pairing, yielding the self-duality <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A \\cong A^\\vee</code>. It sends a pair <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(a, b)</code> to the scalar <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\int_A(\\mu(a, b))</code>.</p>\n<p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a <a href=\"#def:quantum-universe\">quantum universe</a> with multiplication <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu</code> and Frobenius form <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\int_A</code>. The non-degenerate <a href=\"#def:frobenius-pairing\">Frobenius pairing</a> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\langle \\cdot, \\cdot \\rangle = \\int_A \\circ \\mu</code> exists as a morphism in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code>. Its adjoint <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A \\to A^\\vee</code> is an isomorphism. Uniqueness up to scalar is established in <a href=\"#prop:frobenius-pairing-unique\">uniqueness of Frobenius pairing</a>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.md","leanStatus":"proved","heading":"Proposition","number":"2.3.5"}
